        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b179625-LDDVKhnWMIWN.png"
        },
        "description": "__Level:__ 1100\n__Race:__ High Elf\n__Title:__ Skill Master No.3\n\nFell into the VR world of Leadale after her life support began to fail. Since her days in the hospital, she spent most of her time in the VRMMORPG. She is naturally kind to children and to the elderly because of her life experience at the hospital.\n\nCayna had submitted a total of three sub-characters from the Foster System (NPC Compensation Program), two of which she’d purchased in-game. At the time, she had decided all three would be her children. Skargo, the eldest of the three, was an elf and priest type who was highly skilled in the healing arts. Next was her daughter, Mai-Mai, Skargo’s younger sister and also an elf. Finally, Cayna’s youngest, Kartatz was “adopted” even in the conventional sense. ~!Her level later raises to 1109 after breaking the limits of the system.!~",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "17"
      },
